              "text": "**ProFed Federal Credit Union** is a community-focused financial institution serving members across northeast Indiana. \n\nBelow is an overview of key information, contact details, and services for ProFed Credit Union:\n\n### **Key Details**\n*   **Official Website:** [www.profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org) (URLs like `www.profedcreditunion.com` typically redirect to their primary domain).\n*   **Routing Number (for ACH, direct deposit, and wire transfers):** `274973183`\n*   **Headquarters (Main Corporate Branch):**\n    *   **Address:** 1710 St. Joe River Dr., Fort Wayne, IN 46805\n    *   **Phone:** 260-483-0514\n*   **Insurance:** Federally insured by the **NCUA**.\n\n---\n\n### **Contact & Customer Service**\n*   **Toll-Free Phone:** 800-752-4613\n*   **Main Contact Center:** 260-373-1633 (M-F, 8:30 AM to 7:30 PM)\n*   **Email:** contactus@profedcu.org\n*   **Lending Services:** 260-373-1631\n*   **Mortgage Services:** 260-373-1636\n\n---\n\n### **Services Offered**\n*   **Personal Banking:** Checking accounts (including eChecking and Student Checking), Savings accounts, Money Market accounts, and CDs (Certificates of Deposit).\n*   **Loans & Mortgages:** Auto loans, conventional and first-time homebuyer mortgages, home equity lines of credit (HELOCs), and personal loans.\n*   **Business Banking:** Business checking, savings, business credit cards, and specialized business loans.\n*   **Digital & Mobile Banking:** Online bill pay, mobile check deposit, and card controls via their mobile apps for iOS and Android. \n*   **Third-Party Transfer Apps:** ProFed accounts are compatible with **Venmo**, but they do *not* natively integrate with **Zelle**. Alternatively, members can use the built-in peer-to-peer (P2P) money transfer tools in the ProFed mobile app to send money to individuals.",
